- 摘录/摘要:  
  - “The ring of Nestor : a glimpse into the Minoan after-world and a sepulchral
treasure of gold signet-rings and bead-seals from Thisbe / by Sir Arthur Evans.”
  - 目录记录将该著作主题归类为：米诺斯文明、金质印章戒指、玻俄提亚 Thisbe 
出土墓葬宝藏，显示研究聚焦在一个被称为“Ring of 
Nestor”的金质戒指及其图像所反映的米诺斯“来世”观念。  

2. 标题: 'The Ring of Nestor': A Glimpse into the Minoan After-World and A 
Sepulchral Treasure of Gold Signet-Rings and Bead-Seals from Thisbê, Boeotia  
- URL: 
https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/journal-of-hellenic-studies/article/ring
-of-nestor-a-glimpse-into-the-minoan-afterworld-and-a-sepulchral-treasure-of-gol
d-signetrings-and-beadseals-from-thisbe-boeotia/5E465BD1031E9251C962E138498E6CFA
  
- 发布方/作者: Sir Arthur Evans; Journal of Hellenic Studies (Cambridge 
University Press)  
- 日期: 原文最初发表于 1925 年（Cambridge 
页面标为期刊文章；当前页面更新日期显示为 2013-12-23，属数字化上线时间）  
