["20260628165852403005_c0352755"], "citations": [2]}, {"id": 
"20260628170409053226_448982a2", "type": "Evidence", "text": "The Cambridge 
entry summary states that Evans’s article focuses on the 'Ring of Nestor', 
analyzing its imagery in relation to 'the Minoan After-World' and situating it 
among gold signet rings and bead seals from a tomb at Thisbê.", "source_ids": 
["20260628165852403005_c0352755"], "citations": [2]}, {"id": 
"20260628170409140793_2f8834ee", "type": "Evidence", "text": "The Academia.edu 
paper frames its purpose as revisiting the iconography of the 'Ring of Nestor' 
