["20260628170043086880_97dad9bd"], "citations": [3]}, {"id": 
"20260628170409411454_c7c4a932", "type": "Evidence", "text": "The iconography 
study is said to include discussion of '制作工艺和金工技术' (manufacturing 
techniques and goldworking) compared with other confirmed Minoan/Mycenaean 
rings, aiming to provide '新的技术层面证据' (new technical-level evidence) for 
