'新的材料和工艺证据' (new material and technique evidence).", "source_ids": 
["20260628170403694581_fe8ad1ab"], "citations": [12]}, {"id": 
"20260628170409662919_4563e0ec", "type": "Evidence", "text": "The JSTOR search 
result snippet lists: 'Gold intaglios, Minoan, 1 ff. Griffin on ring of Nestor, 
